    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Super Scratch Cards is a Wacky Convenience Mart  Scratch Card Simulator!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553460/extras/4a3099c518ca2a0fe5315bb626f89067.webp?t=1752386584\" width=227 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<i>You gonna buy something or not?</i>&quot; the Seedy Shopkeeper barks at you. &quot;<i>This Mart don't run itself.</i>&quot; Undeterred, you've set out to get some scratch. Scratch that, you're going to scratch them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Super Scratch Cards is a game by Strong Arm Studios.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553460/extras/a5a0fe0261ec6960709b772cdc163b7c.webp?t=1752386584\" width=227 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a variety of colorful cards to scratch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scratch cards across a gamut of gameplay styles; Catch fish, solve puzzles, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn a trough of tools to change the way you scratch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cheat codes to alter difficulty, randomize items, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend the local Seedy Shopkeeper to purchase rare items</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Super Scratch Cards is a Wacky Convenience Mart  Scratch Card Simulator!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553460/extras/4a3099c518ca2a0fe5315bb626f89067.webp?t=1752386584\" width=227 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<i>You gonna buy something or not?</i>&quot; the Seedy Shopkeeper barks at you. &quot;<i>This Mart don't run itself.</i>&quot; Undeterred, you've set out to get some scratch. Scratch that, you're going to scratch them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Super Scratch Cards is a game by Strong Arm Studios.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553460/extras/a5a0fe0261ec6960709b772cdc163b7c.webp?t=1752386584\" width=227 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a variety of colorful cards to scratch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scratch cards across a gamut of gameplay styles; Catch fish, solve puzzles, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn a trough of tools to change the way you scratch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cheat codes to alter difficulty, randomize items, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend the local Seedy Shopkeeper to purchase rare items</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
